  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Federal Power Transmission Program (PFTEE)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Federal de Transporte de Energia Elctrica (PFTEE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la primera operacin es contribuir con la descarbonizacin del sector elctrico al disminuir las emisiones de GEI y al desarrollo local a travs de la ampliacin y modernizacin de los sistemas de transporte de energa elctrica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the first operation is to contribute to the decarbonization of the electricity sector by reducing Green House Gas (GHG) emissions and improving human development through the expansion and modernization of electricity transmission systems.</narrative>
  </description>
